// IntroString :
"P856364347" ""
// SendOffString :
"P1059458683" "Excellent. Here are some dossiers that will bring you up to speed. Our <i>grand</i> plan will be to make Warburg into a new super powered nation to be feared throughout the world. You and Marshal Blitz will be at the head of it, Blitz being the leader of the Rogue Arachnos, while you are seen as the super-powered villain who played 'king maker', as it were.<br><br>Our target is <color yellow>Alexis Cole-Duncan</color>. Marshal Blitz has set up a fake cease-fire and has convinced the US government to send Alexis in as a negotiator. Blitz, in all of his cunning, has also managed to create an even sweeter deal.<br><br>Alexis will only be accompanied by Manticore in the actual meeting room; a squad of Longbow will be monitoring the proceedings in another part of the building. That is where you come in for the first part of our plan.<br><br>You will attack the Longbow security squad to eliminate their back up and also disrupt their monitors on the conference. Manticore and Alexis will attempt to escape when we spring our trap on them. You will have to <color orange>defeat Manticore and take Alexis to a drop off point</color>.<br><br>Be very careful, {HeroName}, Longbow will do everything they can to keep Alexis in safe hands."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1163029880" "Kidnap Alexis Cole-Duncan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P409189275" "The meeting is underway. You had better hurry."
// TaskTitle :
"P3000448312" "<color deepskyblue>Bear Any Burden</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3826934884" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Step Into My Parlour</color>"

