"P2564448561" "You've successfully kidnapped Miss Liberty!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P26078340" "Marshal Blitz was right about you, {HeroName}. You made that last operation look positively effortless. And you made our enemies look like fools. As Marshal Blitz predicted, Manticore and his team are trying to keep this quiet. If it were to get out that Manticore failed and <i>we</i> had Alexis, the US government and their heroes would stop at nothing to get her back.<br><br>Which would, of course, force our hand into launching <i>every</i> missile we have at Paragon. Now, wouldn't <i>that</i> be a shame?<br><br>Wait... hold on.<br><br>... Hmph. Looks like we have a catch in our plan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3686310271" "It seems Manticore has earned his reputation as someone who has all his bases covered. He sent in a squad of heroes to disarm the warheads we had prepared in our WEB facility.<br><br>We already have one armed and ready to launch, but having our entire arsenal disarmed is... <i>irritating</i>.<br><br>We need them to buy us some time. Marshal Blitz has told me that he is still preparing everything to have his national reveal that you and he have kidnapped Alexis Cole-Duncan. Oh, you should prepare your demands, by the way. Blitz has said as long as they aren't <i>too</i> extreme, they should be met.<br><br>Anyway, before we get ahead of ourselves, we need to get the WEB re-armed and those heroes <i>out</i> of there."
// AcceptString :
"P1080070186" "And I suppose that I'm to do that?"
// SendOffString :
"P163073609" "You're the only one who can, {HeroName}. One of our WEB technicians betrayed us and helped the heroes. You'll need to get her back and force her to re-arm all our devices.<br><br>You'll have to fight through a number of heroes, but that shouldn't be too hard for someone of your talents. It's funny, that they're still trying to keep the world in the dark about this. Do you want to know, {HeroName}, one of our further plans with this? It's rather beautiful, a true showing of Marshal Blitz's intelligence.<br><br>We <i>knew</i> that Manticore would try to keep this covered up, to handle it on his own. But what do you think will happen when it's revealed that this was <i>his</i> fault, that Statesman's little daughter was put in such peril because of him?<br><br>It will weaken the Freedom Phalanx, put a tear in their group that cannot be repaired, not easily. Then, you and Blitz can strike the group down, destroying them once and for all!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3811654529" "Re-arm the WEB missiles"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3918010984" "The heroes are starting to get cocky, {HeroName}. We need to get those missiles re-armed."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P700037026" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Scare Tactics</color>"

