// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P737244862" "You've just started what could possibly result in global thermonuclear war. Warburg has been re-armed, and you now have Alexis Cole-Duncan as a bargaining chip."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P716876879" "Great work, {HeroName}! The WEB is armed and ready to go at a moment's notice. Do you know what this means?<br><br>We have a fully stocked arsenal of missiles <i>and</i> <color red>nuclear</color> weapons at our disposal. The heroes can try to stop us, but their cities will be wiped off the face of the earth if they don't give us what we want!<br><br>Not even that dolt Recluse has come this close. Well, that isn't true. He <i>had</i> Warburg at one point, and he willingly chose to let it go. He couldn't realize the brilliance of Marshal Blitz. Speaking of, I believe it's time you and he finally met, face to face."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - WadeDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskOwnerPage Text :
"P2953576664" "<color yellow>Only the task owner can speak to Darrin Wade.</color>"
// Page TakeYourPart Text :
"P609514703" "{HeroName}. Doing well, I hope? I'm sure you have some questions. You're probably quite surprised to see me here.<br><br>Marshal Blitz is, or rather, <i>was</i> a charismatic and cunning man, before his cancer and his treatments began to dull the edge of his mind.<br><br>But, that would be why <i>I</i> am here.<br><br><color orange>Darrin Wade holds up a small vial of blood belonging to Alexis.</color><br><br>Or, rather, this is why I'm here."
// Page TakeYourPart SayOutLoudText :
"P3019051483" "{HeroName}. Doing well, I hope? I'm sure you have some questions, like why I'm here. It's quite simple, really. The blood of Alexis Cole-Duncan is quite important."
// Answer Text :
"P1873657188" "You did all of this just for her blood, Wade?"
// Page JustForBlood Text :
"P279279180" "Oh, there's more to come, but yes, that was one of the things I'm here for. You see, Alexis has very <i>special</i> blood, given how close it is to our dear Statesman.<br><br>I'm sure that Gossamer told you several things about Rogue Arachnos rising to power and what not. Really, it's amazing what an idiotic follower that woman is. This is... <i>much</i> bigger, {HeroName}. <i>And</i>, {HeroName}, this is your chance to become a legend."
// Page JustForBlood SayOutLoudText :
"P4129096745" "You see, Alexis has very special blood, given how close it is to our dear Statesman. I digress, though. This is your chance, {HeroName}, to become a legend."
// Answer Text :
"P2564106889" "Go on."
// Page TakeYourPart2 Text :
"P3856150884" "<color orange>Darrin Wade holds up a pistol.</color><br><br>You can be given the honors of killing Alexis Cole, the daughter of Statesman. I've taken everything I needed from her.<br><br>Her death, {HeroName}, will change the face of the Freedom Phalanx forever. Manticore will be <i>shunned</i> by his own wife and Statesman. Our dear incarnate-powered hero will put on a brave face and vanish for a while. I know this, because I've done the research, I <i>know</i> how he reacted the last time someone close to him, his wife, Monica Richter, died.<br><br>I've spent the past <color yellow>five years</color> putting this plan into motion. And now, I'm offering you the honor of being a hero-killer. What do you say?"
// Page TakeYourPart2 SayOutLoudText :
"P2389012105" "You can be given the honors of killing Alexis Cole, the daughter of Statesman."
// Answer Text :
"P1171556576" "(Kill Alexis) Nothing would make me happier."
// Answer Text :
"P1066647446" "(Refuse) This is your show, Wade. You do it."
// Answer Text :
"P3683028307" "Hold on. Why do you want the Phalanx torn so badly?"
// Page KilledAlexisAlready Text :
"P1504595290" "Now, I was going to just have Manticore walk in here and see Alexis dead, but oh, there is a <i>much</i> better plan.<br><br>Jean will create an illusion that Alexis is still alive, that Manticore has come here <i>just</i> in time. You and Jean will be present here to see Manticore spout some speech about how villainy will never win, and then... <i>snap</i>! Alexis is dead, and Manticore is far too late!"
// Answer Text :
"P921364416" "And then we kick Manticore while he's down."
// Page Answers Text :
"P3812740885" "It's simple, {HeroName}. With Statesman MIA, the Phalanx loses one of its most powerful members. Manticore will be shunned for knowingly keeping information from them.<br><br>It will be a time when someone could, oh, I don't know, do <i>whatever</i> they wished. Perhaps even go after Statesman himself, as he would be alone, without his little pals to help him. It wouldn't just be an opportunity for me, it would be an opportunity for <i>you</i> as well.<br><br>Now, {HeroName}, will you do the honors?"
// Page ChoiceYes Text :
"P3573068618" "<color orange>You take the pistol and shoot Alexis in the head. You watch her body slump onto the slab used for Wade's ritual.</color><br><br>You've ascended to a new place today, {HeroName}. I'm happy to have been here to see it, and our friends Blitz and Jean, oh, you might know Jean as Malaise, are also glad to have seen this.<br><br>Of course, now we have the issue of Longbow and actually revealing that Alexis is dead."
// Answer Text :
"P3157682913" "We could lure Longbow in here with some sort of illusion."
// Page ChoiceNo Text :
"P2535635969" "<color orange>Wade shrugs his shoulders and shoots Alexis in the head.</color><br><br>Don't worry, {HeroName}, I still think quite highly of you. Not all of us are born killers; in fact, I only kill when I have to, if you can believe that.<br><br>Now, however, we must think ahead, towards Longbow and Manticore. We have the aid of Jean here, oh, wait, you might know him as <color yellow>Malaise</color>, to assist us in creating any sort of illusion."
// Page WhatNow Text :
"P922253859" "<color yellow>Darrin Wade flashes a grin at your proposal.</color><br><br>I <i>like</i> the way you think, {HeroName}! I was going to just have Manticore walk in here and see Alexis dead, but oh, this is a <i>much</i> better plan.<br><br>Jean will create an illusion that Alexis is still alive, that Manticore has come here <i>just</i> in time. You and Jean will be present here to see Manticore spout some speech about how villainy will never win, and then... <i>snap</i>! Alexis is dead, and Manticore is far too late!"
// Page KickWhileDown Text :
"P189937605" "Exactly, my fiendish friend. He will, of course, teleport away to safety, but his pride, oh his <i>pride</i> will be hurt!<br><br>There will be... one last thing that needs to be done. Not on your part, of course, but on the part of Malaise. When Manticore is defeated, he will willingly walk out and have himself arrested by Longbow.<br><br>You see, this plan of ours is far from done, {HeroName}. The next part will require Malaise to be quite close to his old mentor, Sister Psyche.<br><br>When he is there, I will, of course, have someone contact you. I consider you to be a major player in this now, {HeroName}. We all have something great to gain from all this. You aren't some mere 'lackey'. You are an equal partner with us in all of this."
// Answer Text :
"P460718643" "Understood. Now, to the matter of Manticore..."
// Page FightingThemAll Text :
"P854526811" "Yes. As far as I know, Manticore and his squad of kiddies are right outside. You'll have to knock them around to get Manticore to come out.<br><br>Oh, and just for kicks, feel free to launch the Warburg rocket. It'll provide an excellent escape for you once Manticore is defeated. I'll be making my exit as well. Until we meet again, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P591590492" "Very well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P655721784" "Manticore and his squad of Longbow are scrambling to find where we're keeping Alexis. If only they knew, hrm?<br><br>With all of this said and done, I believe it's time you and Marshal Blitz meet, face to face. He's quite excited to meet you know. He is currently with Alexis now, along with a few other cohorts who have helped set these events in motion."
// AcceptString :
"P3904261203" "If this is a trap, Gossamer, I -will- survive it."
// SendOffString :
"P4119487638" "Oh no, it isn't a trap at all, {HeroName}! We've seen enough times how those get botched. No, this is a meeting to discuss what to do next.<br><br>We have the girl, we have the missiles, now all we need to do is issue our demands to the government and watch the fallout. It'll be brilliant!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3632544092" "Meet with Marshal Blitz"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3670799994" "Marshal Blitz is waiting for you as we speak."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P977425096" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: One More Life </color>"

