"P4199979659" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CadetBlue>Manticore is on your position, {HeroName}! Hurry, I've lost contact with Marshal Blitz!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3854272799" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CadetBlue>They've captured Marshal Blitz, {HeroName}! Longbow has captured him! This... this is the end, of everything!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3399251172" "Darrin Wade"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3629120582" "<t=10 d=5>Ah, our good friend {HeroName} is here.<t=15 d=5>Yes, it is a pleasure. Do you enjoy how we've set up our nice little ritualistic sacrifice, {HeroName}?<t=10 d=5>It was always part of the plan, Blitz. You just weren't told about it.<t=5 d=5>I'm not keeping you in the dark, Blitz. This is all part of the grand plan.<t=10 d=5>And, after all, once this is finished, I -am- curing you of your cancer. Or did you forget that?<t=5 d=5>Good. Now, {HeroName}, let's have a chat about this whole little ritual."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3842828714" "'Jean'"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P54859154" "<t=5 d=5><t=10 d=5>Pleasure to have you here, {HeroName}.<t=5 d=5>Can we get this over with? I'm looking forward to meeting that special someone..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3713099645" "I'll stay behind to get our grand illusion prepared."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3085100989" "Marshal Blitz"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1808491617" "<t=20 d=5><t=10 d=5>Hold on, what are you two talking about? Killing her wasn't part of the plan, Wade!<t=15 d=5>You think you can keep me in the dark like this?!<t=5 d=5>...Fine."
