// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1810673767" "<t=5 d=5><t=10 d=5>Come now, Manticore, you're saying you do not enjoy my grand play?<t=10 d=5>You could never hope to comprehend the true mind of an artist, Manticore.<t=10 d=5>Blitz was but a side character. {HeroName} and I are the protagonists. Shall we reveal the next act?<t=10 d=5>Now... behold, Manticore, the revelation of your lifetime!<t=10 d=5>Dead would be the word you're looking for."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3552541062" "Excellent work. Now, if you'll excuse me, {HeroName}. I need to go get myself properly arrested."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P519358361" "This isn't... over... not by a longshot."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3137741240" "<t=10 d=5>MALAISE! Put Alexis down, NOW! This insane scheme that you and {HeroName} have is over!<t=10 d=5>You and {HeroName} have brought us to the brink of annihilation, Malaise! And for what?!<t=10 d=5>We have Blitz, Malaise. It's over, stop the ritual!<t=10 d=5>Don't do anything stupid, Malaise!<t=10 d=5>What... Alexis?! She's...<t=10 d=5>You... you and {HeroName} are going to PAY for this, Malaise!!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793214176" "I'm dead!"

