"P3933269587" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Several hours later, within a prison cell in Paragon City..."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1429638537" "<em point>Why, Jean? Why do all of this? We all -trusted- you!"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P816683691" "You can read minds, Shalice. Why don't you read mine?"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1429094414" "<em disagree>I'm not here to play games! Were you behind the attack on Synapse? On Numina's father?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P106648001" "Do you think the story is that simple, Shalice? There are many layers, many pages..."
// 5 Actor2 :
